<title>UK: Abbey National adds 100 bln lire to bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National adds 100 bln lire to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 300 billion lire from 200 billion lire, joint lead managers BNP Capital Markets and Credito Italiano said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL</p>
<p> AMT ** 300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.625     MATURITY    05.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.095   PAY DATE    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES   ** ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 200 BLN LIRE ON 03.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
